# Evidence — 무스코프 MCP 읽기를 닫았다 (결정 2 → D39)

Date: 2026-07-31 · gate 1605 · brief `docs/plans/2026-07-31-unscoped-mcp-read.md`
Cluster: kind platform-agent (3 nodes, v1.34.0) — LIVE

## 0. 왜 열려 있었나 — 그 이유가 사실이 아니었다

The stated reason was "unscoped reads must keep working because the verified
anonymous kagent round trip goes through them". Checked against the code and
the recorded evidence:

  * that round trip is OUTBOUND — we call kagent, and `k8s_get_resources` is
    kagent's own tool on kagent's credentials (docs/evidence/a2a-phase2-live-e2e.log)
  * `a2a_server` routes /message:send to the Supervisor, never to this gateway
  * nothing in src/ constructs an MCPServer at all — the only exerciser of the
    unscoped path was the test pinning it

